Grape - provenance and third-party notices

Credits
-------
Grape is an independent implementation, written from scratch. It is compatible
with Silicate (https://git.puppy.lgbt/silicate/silicate) macro and save
formats, and credits Silicate as inspiration. No Silicate source code is
included.

